{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ROM","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"羅馬書","commonName":"羅馬書","title":"羅馬書","order":45,"numberOfChapters":16,"sha256":"50bf9b1ce2008ea219f7dc52ed37c0207386446e1e99fe1fc090811ce936fa2e","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ROM/1.json","lastChapterNumber":16,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ROM/16.json","totalNumberOfVerses":431},"chapter":{"number":10,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["弟兄姊妹，我心裡切望並向上帝祈求的，就是以色列人能夠得救。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["我可以作證：他們對上帝有熱心，但不是基於真知。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["因為他們不知道上帝的義，想努力建立自己的義，不肯服從上帝的義。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["其實基督是律法的終極目的，使所有相信的人都可以得到義。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["求告主名的都必得救"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["關於律法的義，摩西寫道：「遵行律法的人必因此而活。」",{"noteId":35}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["但是關於以信心為本的義，聖經上說：「不要心裡說，『誰要升到天上去呢？』",{"noteId":36},"意思是誰要把基督領下來，"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["或說，『誰要下到陰間去呢？』",{"noteId":37},"意思是誰要把基督從死人中領上來。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["其實這裡是說：「這話語近在咫尺，就在你口裡，在你心中。」",{"noteId":38},"這話語就是我們所傳的信主之道。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["你若口裡承認耶穌是主，心裡相信上帝使祂從死裡復活，就必得救。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["因為人心裡相信就可以被稱為義人，口裡承認就可以得救。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["聖經上說：「信靠祂的人必不會蒙羞。」",{"noteId":39}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["猶太人和希臘人並沒有分別，主是所有人的主，祂厚待所有求告祂的人，"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["因為「凡求告主名的人都必得救」",{"noteId":40},"。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["可是，人還沒信祂，怎能求告祂呢？還沒聽說過祂，怎能信祂呢？沒有人傳道，怎能聽說過祂呢？"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["人沒有受差遣，怎能傳道呢？正如聖經上說：「那傳福音之人的腳蹤是何等佳美！」",{"noteId":41}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["只是並非人人都信福音，就像以賽亞先知所說的：「主啊！誰相信我們所傳的呢？」",{"noteId":42}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["由此可見，聽了道，才會信道；有了基督的話，才有道可聽。"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["但我要問，以色列人沒有聽過嗎？當然聽過。因為",{"text":"「他們的聲音傳遍天下，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們的話語傳到地極。」","poem":1},{"noteId":43}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":["我再問，難道以色列人不知道嗎？首先，摩西說：",{"text":"「我要藉無名之民挑起你們的嫉妒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用愚昧的國民激起你們的怒氣。」","poem":1},{"noteId":44}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":["後來，以賽亞先知又放膽地說：",{"text":"「我讓沒有尋找我的人尋見，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我向沒有求問我的人顯現。」","poem":1},{"noteId":45}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":["至於以色列人，他說：",{"text":"「我整天伸出雙手招呼那悖逆頑固的子民。」","poem":1},{"noteId":46}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":35,"caller":"+","text":"利未記18·5。","reference":{"chapter":10,"verse":5}},{"noteId":36,"caller":"+","text":"申命記30·12。","reference":{"chapter":10,"verse":6}},{"noteId":37,"caller":"+","text":"申命記30·13。","reference":{"chapter":10,"verse":7}},{"noteId":38,"caller":"+","text":"申命記30·14。","reference":{"chapter":10,"verse":8}},{"noteId":39,"caller":"+","text":"以賽亞書28·16。","reference":{"chapter":10,"verse":11}},{"noteId":40,"caller":"+","text":"約珥書2·32。","reference":{"chapter":10,"verse":13}},{"noteId":41,"caller":"+","text":"以賽亞書52·7。","reference":{"chapter":10,"verse":15}},{"noteId":42,"caller":"+","text":"以賽亞書53·1。","reference":{"chapter":10,"verse":16}},{"noteId":43,"caller":"+","text":"詩篇19·4。","reference":{"chapter":10,"verse":18}},{"noteId":44,"caller":"+","text":"申命記32·21。","reference":{"chapter":10,"verse":19}},{"noteId":45,"caller":"+","text":"以賽亞書65·1。","reference":{"chapter":10,"verse":20}},{"noteId":46,"caller":"+","text":"以賽亞書65·2。","reference":{"chapter":10,"verse":21}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ROM/10.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ROM/11.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ROM/9.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":21}